@startuml ENG-MI管理用例图

title ENG模块 - MI管理子模块用例图

left to right direction

actor 工程师 as engineer
actor 审核员 as reviewer

rectangle "MI管理" {
  usecase "创建MI\n(UC-ENG-009)" as UC009
  usecase "基于工艺路线生成MI草稿\n(UC-ENG-010)" as UC010
  usecase "更新MI\n(UC-ENG-011)" as UC011
  usecase "审批MI\n(UC-ENG-012)" as UC012
  usecase "发布MI\n(UC-ENG-013)" as UC013
}

engineer --> UC009 : 创建MI
engineer --> UC010 : 生成MI草稿
engineer --> UC011 : 更新MI
engineer --> UC013 : 发布MI
reviewer --> UC012 : 审批MI

UC009 ..> UC010 : <<include>>
UC009 ..> UC011 : <<extend>>
UC011 ..> UC012 : <<extend>>
UC012 ..> UC013 : <<extend>>

note right of UC009
  创建制造指令
  包含客户型号、技术参数等
  MI内容以JSON格式存储
end note

note right of UC010
  基于工艺路线自动生成MI草稿
  预填指令集列表
  工程师可在此基础上编辑完善
end note

note right of UC012
  审批MI
  状态转换：REVIEWING → APPROVED
  或退回DRAFT
end note

note right of UC013
  发布MI
  状态转换：APPROVED → RELEASED
  发布后的MI可用于生产版本发布
  和生产订单/工单下达
end note

@enduml
